FROM phi3.5

# Configurações de temperatura e top-p
PARAMETER temperature 0.3
PARAMETER top_p 0.9

# Comprimento máximo de contexto
PARAMETER num_ctx 4096

# Cache de prefixo (KV cache)
PARAMETER num_batch 128
PARAMETER num_predict 512

# System prompt compacto
SYSTEM You are a helpful documentation assistant. Answer questions about the provided documentation context. Be concise and accurate. Format lists with markdown.
